<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88501" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσακτέον</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσάγω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must
				bring to</i> or <i>near,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				537a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κάτω πρὸς τὸ ἄνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			; <i>one must apply, administer,</i> of instruments or
			drugs, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				5.130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				74
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν μουσικήν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1340b13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραδείγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Rh.Al.</u>
					1438b40
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ φύσει τοῦ πράγματος π. τὴν τέχνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Stat.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσακτέος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
					<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
			<i>to be applied,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡσυχίη π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be administered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος οὐ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					5.31.10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
